{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "streaming/a-generation-cut-from-outside-counts-the-input-it-told",
  "title": "A generation in flight that told its input as its stream started counts that input when its turn is cut from outside once its reader read it: the caller and the record read it beside what the generations before it used, and incomplete",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4 The turn's record",
    "§12.2 step 13s"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.1-102",
    "RK-10.1-112",
    "RK-10.1-115",
    "RK-10.6.8-018",
    "RK-10.6.8-022",
    "RK-6.4-425",
    "RK-6.4-435",
    "RK-6.4-441"
  ],
  "notes": "RMK-369 (HITL 69bc2a10, 242a9f5e). The reader holds after the second generation's first text, the told input read before it; the cut comes then. The neighbour streaming/a-generation-in-flight-at-a-cut-is-not-counted keeps a generation that told nothing out. Python: core/mixins/_streaming_segments.py _GenerationsRead (a partial UsageMarker).",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "ws",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport",
        "streams": true,
        "deliver_stream": [
          {
            "hold_after": "Two ",
            "hold_gate": "read"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "agent",
        "type": "ai",
        "model": {
          "name": "opus",
          "provider": "anthropic",
          "rounds": [
            {
              "text": "One.",
              "calls": [
                {
                  "id": "c1",
                  "name": "lookup"
                }
              ],
              "usage": {
                "input_tokens": 1000,
                "output_tokens": 10
              }
            },
            {
              "usage_at_start": {
                "input_tokens": 2000
              },
              "deltas": [
                "Two ",
                "more."
              ],
              "usage": {
                "input_tokens": 2000,
                "output_tokens": 10
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "tools": [
          {
            "name": "lookup",
            "description": "Look it up.",
            "returns": "found"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "ws"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "agent",
            "category": "intelligence"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "ws",
        "sender_id": "alice",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "Go."
        },
        "delivery_key": "k"
      },
      "background": true,
      "as": "a"
    },
    {
      "wait_for": "read"
    },
    {
      "call": "cancel_delivery",
      "key": "k",
      "reason": "stopped",
      "expect": {
        "result": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "open": "read"
    },
    {
      "await": "a",
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "cancellation_reason": "stopped",
          "response_metadata": {
            "turns": {
              "agent": {
                "loop_end_reason": "cancelled",
                "ai_usage": {
                  "input_tokens": 3000,
                  "output_tokens": 10
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ],
  "expect": {
    "timeline": {
      "room-1": [
        {
          "index": 0
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "content": {
            "body": "One."
          }
        },
        {
          "index": 2
        },
        {
          "index": 3
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "content": {
            "body": "Two "
          },
          "metadata": {
            "loop_end_reason": "cancelled",
            "ai_usage": {
              "input_tokens": 3000,
              "output_tokens": 10
            },
            "ai_last_usage": {
              "input_tokens": 2000,
              "output_tokens": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            },
            "ai_usage_complete": false,
            "ai_model": "opus",
            "ai_provider": "anthropic"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
